  "description": "LAXQIN crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H120 O42 Tb9 1-,H4 N1 1+,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.615-5.159 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.36-168.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula NH4[Tb9(μ4-O)2(μ3-OH)8(μ2-acac)8(t-acac)8]·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
